U-Boot is built from upstream **v2026.07** plus patches under this tree.

  BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_CUSTOM_VERSION_VALUE="2026.07"
  BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_PATCH = sunxi usb ubi i2c spl board tools

Do not pin danste22/Turing-pi-u-boot from Buildroot. The fork at
`../turing-bmc-bootloader` (branch `tp2-v2026.07`) is the working copy used
to export these patches with `git format-patch`.

| Directory | Role |
|-----------|------|
| sunxi | SPL SPI NAND + T113/R528 |
| usb | musb UDC/DM gadget |
| ubi | DM UBI + `ubi 0:volname` |
| i2c | mvtwsi early EEPROM read + i2c2 pinmux |
| spl | bloblist handoff |
| board | EEPROM MAC (read-only), v2.5+ UBI 255 MiB, switch reset-release only |
| tools | skip mkeficapsule unless host GnuTLS has p11-kit |
